        <mxCell id="p1_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Current execution contract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One SRAM access per edge. Instruction fetch and operand access share this port. Control pulses qualify every capture and transfer.&lt;br&gt;Sequential instruction issue: two slots exist, but loads do not overlap compute. Partial sums persist across reduction tiles. Scaled results may forward to X or store to SRAM." vertex="1" parent="p1_1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;strokeColor=#333333;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=5;align=left;fillColor=#F1F5FF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;spacing=12;">
